# The specifications in specs/ are the source of truth on what Pixano is and how it is built.
# One owner reviews every change to them, and to the files that enforce that review.
#
# Each pattern starts with a slash: without it, `specs/` would also match docs/specs/.
# The last matching pattern wins: a broader line added below these would take them over.
/specs/                             @jrabary
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @jrabary
/.github/workflows/specs.yml        @jrabary
/.github/scripts/check_specs_pr.py  @jrabary
